一个透明的长方体亚克力砖块相框。\n相框里面，是【图片中人物】自己缩小版卡通风格头像，头像有着闪亮卡哇伊的大眼睛，简单的表情，干净粗线条，以及鲜艳的平涂色彩，并且完美匹配了【图片中人物】的发型、衣物、头发、发饰和主要特征。\n背景是一个充满活力的彩色电竞房夜景，墙上贴着海报，由背景里的电脑显示器和LED灯带发出的紫色和蓝色霓虹灯光照亮，形成了美丽的虚化光斑效果。\n整体光线具有电影感且色彩丰富，在人物身上投下了柔和的光晕。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [270, 314], "pos": [689.3659057617188, 300], "widgets_values": ["89a0088acd85148b23b52375f81e0082036c24bf63ed90d7d7e5ead11500d70d.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-622, -221], "scale": 1}}, "groups": [], "links": [[1, 2, 0, 1, 0, "IMAGE"], [2, 3, 0, 2, 0, "IMAGE"], [4, 4, 0, 2, 5, "STRING"]], "id": "e7aa5c21-c6e8-440f-9459-c1030873673a", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 4, "revision": 0}